I now have some more information about that memory fault (on my Sun
4/110, running SunOS 4.0.3).  I have the game saved on level 24, so
that if I drop down to level 25, the game Memory Faults.  It has
happened 4 times in a row, so I believe it will continue to happen.

Level 25 is (according to a ^O) the Medusa level.  That may have
something to do with it.  (I am playing as Wizard.)

I look forward to hearing from the development team, as well as from
any other Nethackers who may have run into this problem.

